post_install() {
  cat <<'MSG'
Spade65 is in the application menu as "Spade65".

The udev rule that grants hidraw access was installed. Replug the keyboard,
or reload the rules now:

  sudo udevadm control --reload-rules && sudo udevadm trigger

The rule tags the device with uaccess, so the logged-in user gets access
without joining a group.
MSG
}

post_upgrade() {
  post_install
}
